sequenceDiagram
    participant Other as Other App / User
    participant PDS
    participant Tap
    participant App
    participant Store as Local Store

    Note over Tap,PDS: Tap subscribes to PDS firehose (persistent WebSocket)
    Other->>PDS: PUT record
    PDS-->>Tap: emits event on firehose stream
    Tap->>App: POST /webhooks/tap
    App->>Store: Upsert
    App->>Browser: SSE push
